            In this course, students will be able to learn about the following topics: Lives people live, Science and technology, The arts, Home sweet home, Time to learn, Just the job, Consumer society and Well-being. It is an academically rich course for teenage students with emphasis on critical thinking skills, exam skills, and a focus on life skills. This will grow students’ knowledge and skills.
